    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "During the winter vacation, I read the famous novel "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Matilda"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " by Roald Dahl, and was "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " impressed by Matilda, the main character in the book."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Matilda is bright and wise from a(n) "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " age and, by the age of five, had already read most classic writings. Unfortunately, even though she is very smart, she has the most "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "vulgar",
            "zh": "粗俗的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "snobbish",
            "zh": "势利的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " parents and a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "vicious",
            "zh": "恶毒的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " principal. But Matilda doesn’t lose "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". She finds her own way to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " them. While battling with Principal Trunchbull, Matilda develops a "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " friendship with her kind teacher, Miss Honey. And something amazing happens—she discovers that she actually has superpowers! With her intelligence and these special powers, she successfully defeats the vicious headmaster and "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " her vulgar and snobbish parents."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "After reading "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Matilda"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", I was greatly inspired. I realize that I am very "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in my life. My parents care a lot for me, whether in daily life or in my studies. They often encourage and help me when I am "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They have "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "selflessly",
            "zh": "无私地"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and patiently taught me how to be a good person who helps others. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " this, I’ve decided to study hard and be there for those who need me. Most importantly, I will not "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " any difficulties I meet in life and will face them bravely, just like Matilda did!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
